{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15108280","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510827001:":{"text":"하필 창이 없을 때...","source_cn":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79AE633A47391E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510827002:":{"text":"어떻게 된 거지?","source_cn":"怎么回事？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E93FB70774C3CBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510828001:1":{"text":"멧돼지들이 갑자기 잠들다니...","source_cn":"这些野猪突然睡着了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0D941471969A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510828002:1":{"text":"...풍요의 신의 가호인가?","source_cn":"……是丰饶神的护佑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFC73F0A2DBFB0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510828003:0":{"text":"세이툰이 그런 한가한 짓을 할 줄은 몰랐네.","source_cn":"赛图恩还有这种闲心？我怎么不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0544A0961D8DB6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510828004:1":{"text":"루? 내 창이 어째서 네 손에 있는 거야?","source_cn":"露？我的枪为什么在你手上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A58959111E8EA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"장창","source_cn":"长枪","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E832FDFA2858D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510828005:0":{"text":"네가 멧돼지를 상대하고 있을 때, 돼지우리에서 주워 왔어.","source_cn":"你分心对付野猪时，从它巢穴里捡来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E7665F4991BE08B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510828006:1":{"text":"이건 풍요의 신께서 내게 하사하신 신성한 무기야. 난...","source_cn":"这是丰饶神赐予我的神圣武器，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507DB8CA05723A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510828007:0":{"text":"설명하지 않아도 돼. 나는 신의 사도니까, 이게 뭔지는 나도 알고 있어.","source_cn":"不用解释，我是神使，自然知道它是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C6664B262C1A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510828008:1":{"text":"어서 가져가. 사냥의 신은 세이툰의 기운을 좋아하시지 않으니까.","source_cn":"快把它拿走，狩猎神不喜欢赛图恩的气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF0C9C764E2DFC85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510828009:1":{"text":"루, 세이툰 님은 내가 믿는 신이야. 신앙이 다르다고 해도, 내 앞에서 그분을 모욕해서는 안 돼.","source_cn":"露，赛图恩是我信奉的神明，就算信仰不同，也不要在我面前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87BA40FEE1031F52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510828010:0":{"text":"난 세이툰을 싫어해. 자, 이제 어떡할 셈이지? 날 죽이기라도 할 거야?","source_cn":"我讨厌赛图恩，你打算怎么办？你会因此杀了我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4FCF10FEB053C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510828011:0":{"text":"...널 죽인다고? 아니.","source_cn":"……杀了你？我不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB327000F393905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510828012:0":{"text":"어째서?","source_cn":"为什么？<key:dialog51>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17DCA3A73382F439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510828013:0":{"text":"넌 내가 아쿠보르의 영토에 자주 드나든다는 걸 알고 있으면서도, 너의 동족에게 알리지 않았기 때문이지.","source_cn":"因为你明知道我经常潜入雅库伯尔的领地，却没有把这个消息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C14C82F2BDA9F4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510828014:1":{"text":"넌 날 해치지도, 다른 루나애니가 날 해치게 하지도 않았으니, 나도 널 해치지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"你没有伤害我，也没有让其他兽人伤害我，所以我也不会伤害你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x801B1C4966CC3C80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510828015:0":{"text":"어쩌면 알릴 시간이 없었던 걸지도 모르지.","source_cn":"也许我只是还没来得及说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BCAD0398196FC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510828016:0":{"text":"아니, 넌 네 종족에게 알리지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"你不会说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5B732E28530499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510828017:0":{"text":"난 자신감 넘치는 사람이 싫어. 하지만 이상하게도 넌 싫지가 않아.","source_cn":"我讨厌自信的人，可是，我似乎并不讨厌你。这真奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A1C41A70748E9D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510828018:1":{"text":"넌 내가 보칼리스 때문에 왔다는 걸 알고 있어.","source_cn":"你知道我为呼临而来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D29F8A0744CF943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510828019:0":{"text":"알아. 그리고 넌 할 수 없다는 것도 알고 있지.","source_cn":"我知道。而且知道，你做不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A896D7908683AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510828020:1":{"text":"뭘 할 수 없다는 거지?","source_cn":"做不到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8775A9A08F4ED53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510828021:0":{"text":"전쟁을 일으키는 거.","source_cn":"发动战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CAD3D59E2BBE0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510828022:0":{"text":"넌 사냥꾼이 될 수 없어. 적과 마주했을 때, 곧바로 창을 던지지 않으면 반대로 넌 표적이 되어 사냥감이 되고 말 거야.","source_cn":"你当不成猎人。面对敌人，如果不立刻掷出长枪，反而会被盯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8171FFF45505C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510828023:1":{"text":"넌 적이 아니야. 난 아쿠보르가 보칼리스의 적이 되는 것도 원하지 않아.","source_cn":"你不是敌人。我也不希望雅库伯尔成为呼临的敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B094B79FF4C0D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510828024:1":{"text":"비록 보칼리스는 지금 곤경에 처해있지만, 너희까지 휘말리게 할 수는 없어.","source_cn":"呼临面对困境，但你们不该被卷入其中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78ED8F5C6A4A3616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510828025:0":{"text":"그럼, 이제 돌아가는 거야? 정찰은 끝났어?","source_cn":"那么，你要回去了？侦查结束了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x421F5F99C2E752C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510828026:1":{"text":"정찰은 침략을 위한 것이야. 난 이제 돌아가서 영주님과 의원들을 설득하고, 다시는 이곳에 오지 않을 생각이야.","source_cn":"侦查是为了侵入，我会回去劝诫领主和议事官，然后永不再来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F61377A4026036D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510828027:0":{"text":"...페르세우스, 넌 정말 영원히 나를 해치지 않을 거야?","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯，你永远都不会伤害我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F2A5513BE2240AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510828028:1":{"text":"응.","source_cn":"不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17303D442F14E5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510828029:0":{"text":"약속할 수 있어?","source_cn":"你保证？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x953E6625DCE52453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510828030:1":{"text":"약속할게.","source_cn":"我保证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824A6136F9F66844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510828031:1":{"text":"그럼, 다시 이곳에서 만나자. 바로 여기서. 너와 나, 오직 우리 둘만.","source_cn":"那么，再在这里相见吧。就在这里，仅你和我，再无他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24FE26B5D4AE46B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510828032:0":{"text":"왜 하필 여기서 끊기는 거야? 그다음은!","source_cn":"怎么偏偏断在这里？真让人着急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8F55E40A98D98D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1510828033:0":{"text":"모르간, 당신이 이런 장르를 좋아한다는 건 처음 알았네요.","source_cn":"摩根，我才知道你喜欢看这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F500E7771F722E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1510828034:0":{"text":"분위기가 달아올랐으니까, 반응은 해줘야 할 거 아니야.","source_cn":"气氛都到这了，我总得给点反应捧个场吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD70F504FD4AB46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:42:1510827001:":{"text":"하필 창이 없을 때...","source_cn":"偏偏是现在，枪不在身边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79AE633A47391E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:42:1510827002:":{"text":"어떻게 된 거지?","source_cn":"怎么回事？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E93FB70774C3CBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:15010802:0":{"text":"무장 해제된 페르세우스가 멧돼지 떼에 포위당했고, 루가 몰래 주문을 걸어 멧돼지를 기절시켰다. “하늘의 도움”을 받은 페르세우스는 혼란스러워졌다.","source_cn":"手无寸铁的珀尔修斯被野猪包围，露暗自施法迷晕野猪，“天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA40F01CD41CD4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:45:15010802:0":{"text":"무장 해제된 페르세우스가 멧돼지 떼에 포위당했고, 루가 몰래 주문을 걸어 멧돼지를 기절시켰다. “하늘의 도움”을 받은 페르세우스는 혼란스러워졌다.","source_cn":"手无寸铁的珀尔修斯被野猪包围，露暗自施法迷晕野猪，“天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA40F01CD41CD4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:露":{"text":"루","source":"露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","sou